* A name of org/do/lo (an offset, do.w 1) before (pc) is a constant like an equate: both r68s
* take it for the displacement itself (move.w W_Two(pc),d0: $303A $0002); the translation took
* it for an address (as: the distance to $0002). lo, and do after another org, too; d(An)
* unchanged.
* fixed: 77aed7c 2026-10-14 r68togas: names of offsets (do, lo) are constants before (pc)
* expect text: 303a0002 223a0004 343a1000 163a0003 41fa0006 382a0002 4e75 4e71
 psect pc_const_offset,0,0,0,0,0
 org 0
W_One do.b 1
W_Two do.w 1
W_Thr do.l 2
 org $1000
W_Far do.w 1
 org 8
W_Neg lo.w 1
W_Neb lo.b 3
 move.w W_Two(pc),d0
 move.l W_Thr(pc),d1
 move.w W_Far(pc),d2
 move.b W_Neb(pc),d3
 lea W_Neg(pc),a0
 move.w W_Two(a2),d4
 rts
 ends
